Subject: [PATCH 399/913] dts: stm32 add subnode counter for timers15 in
 stm32mp151

Add subnode counter for timers15 in stm32mp151.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git b0b2070ce0b9c3e85e1dea7292767711ac1d38ed dts: stm32 add subnode counter for timers15 in stm32mp151]
Change-Id: I460fcafd62e8a17e4542d239ef1ce9526e465bc5
Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/564267
Domain-Review: Fabrice GASNIER <fabrice.gasnier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Fabrice GASNIER <fabrice.gasnier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi
index 8a13fca5e..84a6bb2d4 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp151.dtsi
@@ -1314,6 +1314,11 @@
 				access-controllers = <&etzpc STM32MP1_ETZPC_TIM15_ID>;
 				status = "disabled";
 
+				counter {
+					compatible = "st,stm32-timer-counter";
+					status = "disabled";
+				};
+
 				pwm {
 					compatible = "st,stm32-pwm";
 					#pwm-cells = <3>;
